{"title":"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph below shows the number of students in Ms. Gupta’s class that have their birthday in 2016 on each day of the week.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>If 25% of the students in the class have their birthday on a day that begins with the letter “T”, how many of the students in the class have their birthday in 2016 on a Tuesday?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of people that have their birthday on Tuesday and are in the class. The number of people in the class that do <i>not</i> have their birthday on Tuesday is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1baa440d88dc85778a8e6b7860bbeed9194a8b06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 4 + 2 + 2 + 8 + 6 = 8 + 4 + 14 = 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"315\" height=\"15\" />, so the total number of people in the class is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/6/ac6e253227ed767056a7d5afe0fbaa6bea342fd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/3/583cd1824b01a9b61eaa8b89c5a6eb6dea0a45bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\% = \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"69\" height=\"37\" /> of the people in the class have their birthday on Tuesday or Thursday, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/f/98f7e59c742572e6d1e868538229b089c2891024.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 2 = \\frac{1}{4}(x + 26)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"146\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/f/9bf84d512f45640a0138774e5252cac43edc331e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(x + 2) = x + 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/9/07938ad5472caf77b987e81d2363eff6af92b9f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x + 8 = x + 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/a/00a68af1401e8e98e498bf62d5855ea539d946d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x - x = 26 - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/4467041b595bee29d1362b709beef7e972f9936c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0eb781904c4cb1e1c00501fae1443cefba1f0ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{18}{3} = \\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/f/ecf15ca0342d9b8310058ccd24bbe06456b721e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 4 + 2 + 8 + 6 = 8 + 2 + 14 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"284\" height=\"15\" /> people whose birthday does <i>not</i> begin with the letter T. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of the people in the class have a birthday that starts with the letter T, this would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abd3724270b5b73065ba1ad00117f34d623e9a99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\% - 25\\% = 75\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"17\" /> of the total people in the class.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/0/da0194a23dc5d5afae8e9ded7e850a654a958886.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{75\\%}{25\\%} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"72\" height=\"41\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the number of people whose birthday starts with the letter T, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/0/0c0d8f0229b87be5a82aa12468c7abc3d8f80623.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{3} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Since these <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> people either have their birthday on a Tuesday or a Thursday and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of these people have their birthday on a Thursday, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/9/0898ae78e5935090f479b1f555682f138f7848a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 - 2 = \\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"87\" height=\"25\" /> of them must have been born on a Tuesday.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC\" title=\"2016 CIMC\">2016 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018061144\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 151/1000000\nPost‐expand include